  "report_impact_coverage": [
    {
      "impact_id": "i_disputer_stuck",
      "evidence": [
        "1. `disputer` remains set to the original disputer address (non-zero)",
        "- `resolveDispute()` is the only function that sets `disputer = address(0)`",
        "- Since it always reverts, `disputer` is permanently set"
      ],
      "claim_ids": [
        "impact_claim_i_disputer_stuck_eb82ec46"
      ],
      "status": "unformalized",
      "reason": "No faithful claim generated after bounded retries: zero-address I condition not observable"
    },
    {
      "impact_id": "i_no_recovery",
      "evidence": [
        "- `recoverERC20()` cannot help because `resolveDispute()` needs to succeed first to clear `disputer`",
        "- Even depositing more tokens doesn't help - the FoT token will take fees on the outgoing transfer too",
        "- Contract upgrade/migration is the only recovery option"
      ],
      "claim_ids": [
        "impact_claim_i_no_recovery_d45f3bc9"
      ],
      "status": "unformalized",
      "reason": "No faithful claim generated after bounded retries: core relation observables lack intent/impact grounding"
    },
